 magic illusions on illusionary_magic; +1 vs other magic on spell_magic and ritual_magic; +5% vs coma/death on coma_death_pct. Damage is prose. || SKILLS: base is the catalog base plus the printed bonus. One Language of choice (+10%) is a pick from Language: Other at +10. Tracking is the catalog''s Tracking (people); Track Animals is Track & Trap Animals. Any Wilderness skill (+10%) is a pick of one from the Wilderness category at +10. R.C.C. Related Skills: none. Secondary: three at level one and one at levels 3, 5, 7, 10 and 13, from Rogue, Wilderness, W.P. and Technical minus computer and machine skills, read as excluding Computer Hacking, Computer Operation, Computer Programming, Cyberjacking and Recognize Machine Quality. || NATURAL ABILITIES: acrobatics 85%, climb 95%/85%, prowl 80% +1% per level, track by smell and recognize scent are the creature''s natural abilities, not taught skills, and are prose rather than skill rows. P.P.E. feeding is prose. || ALIGNMENT: the domesticated split (about half aberrant) is prose. || MONEY: none to start, stored as 0. Slave market value 3D6x100,000 credits, two to three times that for a loyal, strong or experienced Hunter. || EQUIPMENT: none to start; the backpack, belt, trophies and ancient weapons are too vague to grant and are not stored."
